{"version":1,"key":"card:360","content":{"id":360,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"对各种 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"width","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的总结，首先对各个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"width","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 做一个概念的介绍，然后通过实例进行深入的感受：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"269239e0-eefc-483d-b561-30c23113c92e","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"offsetWidth","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"36d89ded-934b-498e-ba0c-fbd435e14d6d","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"元素的内容宽度，包含 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"padding","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"border","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，如果存在滚动条的话，也包含滚动条的宽度。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1a0ebde6-bf4d-43c8-a8c7-163474026aff","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果元素横向发生了滚动呢？也只是包含其占据的宽度，不包含隐藏的滚动的内容。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"37a82604-46ec-432c-848e-72eaac2424fb","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"9380b9c7-c75c-42bf-8c77-9b930dde0d16","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"clientWidth","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"318e585f-4e79-40bd-bd19-acb52bf2ea68","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"包含 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"padding","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，不包含滚动条、边框和外边距。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2ab1e9a1-7826-4aae-b540-98eb9c4d4602","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"c43208e5-d48e-4ff5-8df6-1e196df93738","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"scrollWidth","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c0d19645-a2a4-430b-b578-472937cd3874","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"元素内容的宽度，包括由于滚动在视野之外的，同 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"clientWidth","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 一样，包含 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"padding","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的宽度，不包括滚动条、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"border","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"margin","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的宽度。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cfc11da8-0633-4ffb-8142-b34b31d78652","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果没有发生横向滚动，那么 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"scrollWidth","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的宽度和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"clientWidth","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的大小相同。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"66863717-ab33-42b3-9809-f624dde43dc2","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"822feb91-aac1-46d0-8888-fabdb5961875","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"innerWidth","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a0edc892-16b7-4b31-8815-b346a7c63c5d","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"innerWidth","type":"formatted"},{"text":"表示窗口的内部宽度（不包含 DevTools），它是 window 对象的只读属性，如果存在滚动条，则包含滚动条的宽度。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e55f9996-f296-4a9d-a13f-0ea124fd673e","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"在 jQuery 中存在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"innerWidth()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法，它包括 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"padding","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和滚动条的宽度，不包含 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"border","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9e23d358-8fd4-4708-9ec7-b18f60ec302c","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8a7cae88-c5cc-4a92-8d9b-96efae2c1807","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"}],"collabId":"05a030fb-acca-4a27-9158-374e06c9f09f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"outerWidth","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"985381f9-4431-4926-b307-edbc9a2a2b59","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"outerWidth","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示整个窗口的宽度，它也是 window 对象上的只读属性，包括 DevTools 的宽度（如果打开了的话）","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4c0abc70-f3ea-43d6-8803-2b154abc9841","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"jQuery 也存在一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"outerWidth()","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法，它返回的元素的外部宽度，包括 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"padding","type":"formatted"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"border","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，它接收一个可选参数，表示是否包含 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"margin","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，默认是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"false","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d71370bc-9de1-4d43-b130-d453d857c2d5","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"54cd94d6-8ad3-41e7-b128-7bc3db50b6a4","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"}],"collabId":"2e544c50-120c-49f0-8346-6223d977942b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"5fb9577a-f1b1-4e83-bfb7-22584d0adbb3","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"如果设置了宽度，但是有纵向滚动条，实际内容宽度是设置的宽度减去滚动条的宽度，滚动条的宽度在 Chrome 中默认是 17px。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"42178fb7-09d3-47c1-b881-eb90061580cc","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"befc4936-8e5c-412a-9a74-024d6fc2f8f9","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"calloutType":"note","children":[{"children":[{"text":"如果页面纵向是滚动的，我期望 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"document.documentElement.offsetWidth","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"window.innerWidth","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 相同，但是","type":"formatted"},{"highlight":"red","text":"实际上 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"highlight":"red","text":"document.documentElement.offsetWidth","type":"formatted"},{"highlight":"red","text":"比 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"highlight":"red","text":"window.innerWidth","type":"formatted"},{"highlight":"red","text":"小 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"highlight":"red","text":"17px","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，正是滚动条宽度，页面的滚动条并未算入到 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"document.documentElement","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的宽度中，感觉是一个比较反直觉的事情。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a271dfa1-64f4-4693-8d03-03b99b4003a6","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af